---
import SidebarRightContainer from '~/components/blocks/layout/SidebarRightContainer.astro';
import Headline from '~/components/blocks/primitives/Headline.astro';
---

<SidebarRightContainer
  htmlTag="section"
  containerWidthType="full"
  content={{
    widthType: 'boxed',
    spacing: { padding: 'py-12' },
    border: { width: 'border', color: 'border-border-emphasis border-dotted' },
  }}
  border={{ width: 'border', color: 'border-border' }}
  spacing={{ margin: 'mb-8' }}
>
  <div slot="main" class="bg-surface p-6 rounded border border-border">
    <Headline
      title="Article Title: Modern Web Development"
      htmlTag="h4"
      class="my-0"
      titleClass="mb-4 text-2xl"
    />
    <p>
      The landscape of web development has changed dramatically over the past few years. Modern
      frameworks, tools, and best practices have emerged to help developers build better
      applications faster.
    </p>
    <p>
      From component-based architectures to server-side rendering, the ecosystem continues to
      evolve. Understanding these patterns is essential for building scalable, maintainable
      applications.
    </p>
    <p>
      Performance optimization, accessibility, and user experience remain critical factors in
      successful web development projects.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="sidebar" class="space-y-4">
    <div class="bg-primary text-background p-4 rounded border border-primary">
      <Headline
        title="Metadata"
        htmlTag="h4"
        class="my-0"
        titleClass="mb-2 text-lg text-background"
      />
      <dl class="text-sm space-y-1">
        <div>
          <dt>Author:</dt>
          <dd class="font-medium">Jane Smith</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Published:</dt>
          <dd class="font-medium">Dec 25, 2025</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Category:</dt>
          <dd class="font-medium">Technology</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Reading Time:</dt>
          <dd class="font-medium">5 min</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-success/10 p-4 rounded border border-success">
      <Headline title="Tags" htmlTag="h4" class="my-0" titleClass="mb-2 text-lg text-success" />
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-success text-background text-xs rounded">JavaScript</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-success text-background text-xs rounded">React</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-success text-background text-xs rounded">Astro</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</SidebarRightContainer>
